{"id": "209549", "name": "אינטגרלים כפולים – תחום בין פרבולה לציר x", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "f", "params": ["x"], "body": "expand(ep*k*(x-A)*(x-B))"}], "questiontext": "<div title=\"BGU_STACK_CALC2_DOUBLE_LAYOUT_V4\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width:100%;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.65;text-align:right;\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;\">כתיבת התחום בשני סדרי אינטגרציה</div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;margin-bottom:8px;\">התחום</div>\n<div>יהי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle D\\)</span> התחום שבין ציר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x\\)</span> לבין הפרבולה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:19px;margin:8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle y={{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n[[jsxgraph]]\nvar board=JXG.JSXGraph.initBoard(divid,{boundingbox:[{{CT:1}},{{CT:2}},{{CT:3}},{{CT:4}}],axis:true,showCopyright:false,keepaspectratio:false});\nvar ff=board.jc.snippet('{{CT:5}}',true,'x',true);\nvar fg=board.create('functiongraph',[ff,{{CT:6}},{{CT:7}}],{strokeWidth:2});\nboard.create('integral',[[{{CT:6}},{{CT:7}}],fg],{fillOpacity:0.28,withLabel:false});\n[[/jsxgraph]]</div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;margin-bottom:10px;\">כתבו את התחום בשני סדרי אינטגרציה</div>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(430px,1fr));gap:14px;align-items:start;\">\n  <div style=\"background:#FCFBFC;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;\">\n    <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\int_a^b\\int_{c(x)}^{d(x)}f\\left(x,y\\right)\\,dy\\,dx\\)</div>\n    <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:10px;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;align-items:start;\"><div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;min-width:170px;\"><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle a=\\)</span>[[input:ans1]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:4px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div><div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;min-width:170px;\"><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle b=\\)</span>[[input:ans2]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:4px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div><div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;min-width:170px;\"><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle c(x)=\\)</span>[[input:ans3]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:4px;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div><div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;min-width:170px;\"><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle d(x)=\\)</span>[[input:ans4]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:4px;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div></div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background:#FCFBFC;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;\">\n    <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\int_c^d\\int_{a(y)}^{b(y)}f\\left(x,y\\right)\\,dx\\,dy\\)</div>\n    <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:10px;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;align-items:start;\"><div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;min-width:170px;\"><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle c=\\)</span>[[input:ans5]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:4px;\">[[validation:ans5]]</div></div><div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;min-width:170px;\"><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle d=\\)</span>[[input:ans6]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:4px;\">[[validation:ans6]]</div></div><div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;min-width:170px;\"><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle a(y)=\\)</span>[[input:ans7]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:4px;\">[[validation:ans7]]</div></div><div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;min-width:170px;\"><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle b(y)=\\)</span>[[input:ans8]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:4px;\">[[validation:ans8]]</div></div></div>\n  </div>\n</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: 